 transform:scale(.8);\n  transform-origin:center;\n}\n.flow-label{\n  font-size:11px;\n  line-height:14px;\n  white-space:nowrap;\n}\n.arrow{\n  align-self:flex-start;\n  margin-top:21px;\n  color:#101820;\n  font-size:20px;\n  font-weight:700;\n}\n.supermicro{\n  display:flex;\n  align-items:center;\n  justify-content:center;\n  width:78px;\n  height:29px;\n  border:2px solid #30834b;\n  border-radius:50%;\n  color:#267440;\n  font:700 9px Arial,sans-serif;\n}\n.footer-note{\n  position:absolute;\n  left:27px;\n  top:1514px;\n  font-size:11px;\n  line-height:15px;\n  color:#777;\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <header class=\"document-header\">\n    <h1>半导体 / AI <span class=\"accent\">价值链全景图</span></h1>\n    <div class=\"subtitle\">从设计到智能：端到端生态体系</div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main class=\"value-table\">\n    <div class=\"table-head\">\n      <div>层级</div>\n      <div>主要作用</div>\n      <div>代表企业（示例）</div>\n      <div>在AI生态中的角色</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <section class=\"data-row r1\">\n      <div class=\"cell level c1\">\n        <div class=\"level-top\">\n          <div class=\"number\">1</div>\n          <div class=\"level-title\">架构设计 / IP层</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder icon icon-chip\"><span class=\"sr-only\">[Icon: chip architecture]</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cell action\">创建基础IP<br>和芯片架构</div>\n      <div class=\"cell logos\">\n        <span class=\"logo arm\">arm</span>\n        <span class=\"logo cadence\">cadence</span>\n        <span class=\"logo siemens\">SIEMENS</span>\n        <span class=\"logo allegro\">Allegro<small>MicroSystems</small></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cell role\">定义芯片如何设计，<br>是关键的第一步</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"data-row r2\">\n      <div class=\"cell level c2\">\n        <div class=\"level-top\">\n          <div class=\"number\">2</div>\n          <div class=\"level-title\">芯片设计<br>（无晶圆厂）</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder icon icon-monitor\"><span class=\"sr-only\">[Icon: chip design monitor]</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cell action\">使用IP设计芯片，<br>但不生产</div>\n      <div class=\"cell logos\">\n        <span class=\"logo nvidia\">NVIDIA</span>\n        <span class=\"logo amd\">AMD</span>\n        <span class=\"logo broadcom\">BROADCOM</span>\n        <span class=\"logo qualcomm\">Qualcomm</span>\n        <span class=\"logo marvell\">MARVELL</span>\n        <span class=\"logo macom\">MACOM.</span>\n        <span class=\"logo nxp\">NXP</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cell role\">打造高性能芯片<br>（GPU、CPU、ASIC、<br>SoC、网络芯片等）</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"data-row r3\">\n      <div class=\"cell level c3\">\n        <div class=\"level-top\">\n          <div class=\"number\">3</div>\n          <div class=\"level-title\">晶圆制造<br>（代工）</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder icon icon-factory\"><span class=\"sr-only\">[Icon: semiconductor factory]</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cell action\">在晶圆上制造芯片，<br>使用先进制程</div>\n      <div class=\"cell logos\">\n        <span class=\"logo tsmc\">tsmc</span>\n        <span class=\"logo umc\">UMC</span>\n        <span class=\"logo global\">GlobalFoundries</span>\n        <span class=\"logo intel\">intel.</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cell role\">最资本密集的环节，<br>将设计变为现实</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"data-row r4\">\n      <div class=\"cell level c4\">\n        <div class=\"level-top\">\n          <div class=\"number\">4</div>\n          <div class=\"level-title\">设备<br>（生产设备）</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder icon icon-equipment\"><span class=\"sr-only\">[Icon: manufacturing equipment]</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cell action\">提供制造芯片所需<br>的机器和工具</div>\n      <div class=\"cell logos\">\n        <span class=\"logo asml\">ASML</span>\n        <span class=\"logo applied\">APPLIED<br>MATERIALS.</span>\n        <span class=\"logo lam\">Lam<small>RESEARCH</small></span>\n        <span class=\"logo kla\">KLA<b>+</b></span>\n        <span class=\"logo onto\">Onto<br>innovation</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cell role\">支撑芯片制造的<br>每一步，是进入<br>的高门槛环节</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"data-row r5\">\n      <div class=\"cell level c5\">\n        <div class=\"level-top\">\n          <div class=\"number\">5</div>\n          <div class=\"level-title\">封装与测试<br>（OSAT）</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder icon icon-package\"><span class=\"sr-only\">[Icon: semiconductor package]</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cell action\">封装、打包并测试<br>芯片以确保可用</div>\n      <div class=\"cell logos\">\n        <span class=\"logo amkor\">Amkor<small>Technology</small></span>\n        <span class=\"logo ase\">ASE</span>\n        <span class=\"logo formfactor\">◇ FormFactor</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cell role\">先进封装是AI芯片<br>（HBM、2.5D/3D等）<br>的关键瓶颈</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"data-row r6\">\n      <div class=\"cell level c6\">\n        <div class=\"level-top\">\n          <div class=\"number\">6</div>\n          <div class=\"level-title\">内存</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder icon icon-memory\"><span class=\"sr-only\">[Icon: memory modules]</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cell action\">提供内存芯片<br>（DRAM、HBM、<br>NAND），为AI<br>提供存储与带宽</div>\n      <div class=\"cell logos\">\n        <span class=\"logo micron\">Micron</span>\n        <span class=\"logo wd\"><b>WD</b>Western<br>Digital.</span>\n        <span class=\"logo sandisk\">SanDisk</span>\n        <span class=\"logo seagate\">SEAGATE</span>\n        <span class=\"logo dram\">DRAM</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cell role\">内存带宽是AI<br>工作负载的关键<br>瓶颈之一</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"data-row r7\">\n      <div class=\"cell level c7\">\n        <div class=\"level-top\">\n          <div class=\"number\">7</div>\n          <div class=\"level-title\">电源芯片与<br>电力管理</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder icon icon-power\"><span class=\"sr-only\">[Icon: electric power]</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cell action\">高效交付与管理<br>芯片和系统所需<br>的电力</div>\n      <div class=\"cell logos\">\n        <span class=\"logo mps\">mps <small>MONOLITHIC<br>POWER<br>SYSTEMS</small></span>\n        <span class=\"logo ti\">TEXAS<br>INSTRUMENTS</span>\n        <span class=\"logo st\">ST</span>\n        <span class=\"logo nxp\">NXP</span>\n        <span class=\"logo onsemi\">ON Semiconductor</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cell role\">对AI服务器、GPU、<br>电动车等电力效率<br>至关重要</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"data-row r8\">\n      <div class=\"cell level c8\">\n        <div class=\"level-top\">\n          <div class=\"number\">8</div>\n          <div class=\"level-title\">连接与网络</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder icon icon-network\">\n          <span class=\"links\"></span><span class=\"node\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sr-only\">[Icon: connected network nodes]</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cell action\">在芯片、系统和<br>数据中心之间<br>高速传输数据</div>\n      <div class=\"cell logos\">\n        <span class=\"logo lumentum\">LUMENTUM</span>\n        <span class=\"logo marvell\">MARVELL</span>\n        <span class=\"logo ciena\">ciena.</span>\n        <span class=\"logo coherent\">COHERENT</span>\n        <span class=\"logo credo\">CREDO<small>We Connect.</small></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cell role\">高速连接是AI<br>基础设施的<br>关键骨干</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"data-row r9\">\n      <div class=\"cell level c9\">\n        <div class=\"level-top\">\n          <div class=\"number\">9</div>\n          <div class=\"level-title\">系统与基础设施</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder icon icon-racks\"><span class=\"sr-only\">[Icon: server racks]</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cell action\">将芯片集成到服务器、<br>系统和硬件解决方案</div>\n      <div class=\"cell logos\">\n        <span class=\"logo dell\">DELL<small>Technologies</small></span>\n        <span class=\"logo hpe\">Hewlett Packard<small>Enterprise</small></span>\n        <span class=\"logo ttm\">TTM<small>Technologies</small></span>\n        <span class=\"logo nokia\">NOKIA</span>\n        <span class=\"logo celestica\">CELESTICA<small> ACIO</small></span>\n        <span class=\"logo smci\">SMCI</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cell role\">将芯片变为可部署<br>的企业、云和AI<br>基础设施</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"data-row r10\">\n      <div class=\"cell level c10\">\n        <div class=\"level-top\">\n          <div class=\"number\">10</div>\n          <div class=\"level-title\">云计算 / 超大规模<br>（终端用户）</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder icon icon-cloud\"><span class=\"sr-only\">[Icon: cloud computing]</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cell action\">部署大规模计算<br>基础设施并运行<br>AI应用</div>\n      <div class=\"cell logos\">\n        <span class=\"logo aws\">aws</span>\n        <span class=\"logo azure\">Microsoft<br>Azure</span>\n        <span class=\"logo gcloud\">Google Cloud</span>\n        <span class=\"logo meta\">∞ Meta</span>\n        <span class=\"logo equity\">@equitydd</span>\n        <span class=\"logo oracle\">ORACLE</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cell role\">推动整个AI<br>产业的计算需求</div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <aside class=\"bottom-panel\">\n    <div class=\"takeaway\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder target-icon\"><span class=\"sr-only\">[Icon: target]</span></div>\n      <div class=\"takeaway-title\">关键要点</div>\n      <div class=\"takeaway-text\">\n        AI不只是芯片，而是一个完整的生态系统。<br>\n        每一层都至关重要，任何一个环节的瓶颈，<br>\n        都会影响大规模AI的落地。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flow\">\n      <div class=\"flow-step\">\n        <div class=\"flow-logo\"><span class=\"logo arm\">arm</span></div>\n        <div class=\"flow-label\">IP</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\">→</div>\n      <div class=\"flow-step\">\n        <div class=\"flow-logo\"><span class=\"logo nvidia\">NVIDIA</span></div>\n        <div class=\"flow-label\">芯片设计</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\">→</div>\n      <div class=\"flow-step\">\n        <div class=\"flow-logo\"><span class=\"logo tsmc\">tsmc</span></div>\n        <div class=\"flow-label\">晶圆制造</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\">→</div>\n      <div class=\"flow-step\">\n        <div class=\"flow-logo\"><span class=\"logo amkor\">Amkor</span></div>\n        <div class=\"flow-label\">封装测试</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\">→</div>\n      <div class=\"flow-step\">\n        <div class=\"flow-logo\"><span class=\"logo micron\">Micron</span></div>\n        <div class=\"flow-label\">内存</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\">→</div>\n      <div class=\"flow-step\">\n        <div class=\"flow-logo\"><span class=\"logo mps\">mps</span></div>\n        <div class=\"flow-label\">电源管理</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\">→</div>\n      <div class=\"flow-step\">\n        <div class=\"flow-logo\"><span class=\"logo marvell\">MARVELL</span></div>\n        <div class=\"flow-label\">连接网络</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\">→</div>\n      <div class=\"flow-step\">\n        <div class=\"flow-logo\"><span class=\"supermicro\">SUPERMICRO</span></div>\n        <div class=\"flow-label\">系统集成</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\">→</div>\n      <div class=\"flow-step\">\n        <div class=\"flow-logo\"><span class=\"logo aws\">aws</span></div>\n        <div class=\"flow-label\">云部署</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </aside>\n\n  <footer class=\"footer-note\">注：不构成任何投资建议。图中企业为各层级代表性公司，非完整名单。</footer>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
      },
      "finish_reason": "stop"
    }
